# GMS runs it over 20 levels at 125+3x with 3 attacks; here it is the same
# climb in half the steps, ending where GMS ends.
#
# The only attack in this book, so it carries no cooldown: the pair the other
# two wizards alternate between is what a cooldown is for, and there is no
# pair here. It is also GMS's slowest 2nd-job magician animation and reaches
# the fewest enemies, which is what the Cleric pays for Blessed Ensemble.
